WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
You already know your xStocks and your split.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.960
Each new contribution still needs

3
00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.100
exact amounts and a plan for next time.

4
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.040
This is Lotline, your next contribution, clearly.

5
00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.620
Start with Example mode.

6
00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.780
Explore 832 asset identities and build a plan with
up to 10.

7
00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.680
The balances and estimates here are synthetic
practice data.

8
00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.020
Never market prices.

9
00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.880
Choose your assets, set percentages,

10
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.660
and enter your USDC budget.

11
00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:26.920
These percentages apply to this contribution,

12
00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.500
not your existing portfolio.

13
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.960
Here, 50, 30, and 20% divide the amount exactly.

14
00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.980
Down to the final micro USDC.

15
00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.380
Inspect the calculation and verify this plan.

16
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.840
Search for another company, adjust the split,

17
00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:40.920
and compare the exact contribution amounts.

18
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.120
Copy the plan or download a CSV

19
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:44.820
with its sources and freshness status.

20
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.200
Switch to Live when you need current verification

21
00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.080
and amount specific estimates.

22
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.820
Lotline checks issuer identities and Solana mints

23
00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:53.900
reads holdings and converts raw token amounts

24
00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:54.960
into displayed units.

25
00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:57.400
Jupiter provides route estimates that expire.

26
00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.260
Unavailable routes remain unavailable.

27
00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:01.620
Every quote belongs to a specific amount

28
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:03.320
and expires within 30 seconds.

29
00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.220
Its source and time stay visible,

30
00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.200
so an estimate cannot quietly become a promise.

31
00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:10.980
Your budget and split stay saved on this device.

32
00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.240
Change the amount next time and the old estimates
clear.

33
00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:16.320
Optional accounts add named cloud plans.

34
00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.260
The installable app keeps Example

35
00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.360
planning available offline.

36
00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.380
You can try the full planning flow

37
00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:22.660
before creating an account.

38
00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.600
When ready, copy the exact amount and verified mint.

39
00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:28.040
Then review independently on official Jupiter.

40
00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.580
Lotline never signs or executes a trade.

41
00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.840
One contribution accounted for.

42
00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:34.900
A familiar plan to return to.

